1
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:46,160
The family rules echo
with a lasting charm,

2
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:50,120
the instructions in the hall
are long and profound.

3
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:54,000
Parents are kind and children filial,
like a woven net,

4
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:58,039
brothers are friendly and respectful,
like flying geese.

5
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:02,080
Elders are like pines,
peaceful and steady,

6
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:06,160
a single kind word warms the heart.

7
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:10,120
Wives are virtuous and husbands
harmonious, the family is smooth,

8
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:13,880
managing daily life together,
the years are fragrant.

9
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:17,600
The family rules echo
with a lasting charm,

10
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:21,360
the instructions in the hall
are long and profound.

11
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:25,440
Parents are kind and children filial,
like a woven net,

12
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:29,800
brothers are friendly and respectful,
like flying geese.

13
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:33,480
Elders are like pines,
peaceful and steady,

14
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:37,120
a single kind word warms the heart.

15
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,320
What goes around comes around.

16
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,560
And my kick back then

17
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,920
happened to cripple you.

18
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,570
Second Brother,

19
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:19,560
my path of revenge has just begun.

20
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,600
You will definitely support me,

21
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,320
right?

22
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,730
Second Brother,

23
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,520
I knew

24
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:54,120
you never gave up on me all these years.

25
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:14,010
You take care of my brother so diligently,

26
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:16,600
and you keep muttering by his bed.

27
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,839
It's hard not to suspect

28
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,720
that you've fallen for a vegetable.

29
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:25,440
Even if the Second Young Master
is a vegetable,

30
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:28,610
he's better than a walking beast like you.

31
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,440
Li Zhangxin,

32
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,720
this is the He family,

33
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:38,360
my territory.

34
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:40,560
Please watch your words

35
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:43,200
and show some respect.

36
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:45,320
If you weren't the Eldest Young Master
of the He family,

37
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:46,880
who would even look at you?

38
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,480
You must know that

39
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:52,320
I am also the CEO of the He Group,

40
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,560
the sole heir of the He family.

41
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:56,320
When the old man passes away,

42
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:58,120
everything here

43
00:04:58,880 --> 00:04:59,920
will be mine.

44
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:01,880
Very well,

45
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,560
I've recorded it all.

46
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:08,240
Gone.

47
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:13,440
If the Eldest Young Master
is open and aboveboard,

48
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:14,760
why fear my recording?

49
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:17,240
So the one who should watch
his words is you,

50
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,640
Eldest Young Master.

51
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:31,480
This is the butler's belt, right?

52
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,840
You did it, didn't you?

53
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,360
I looked closely,

54
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:37,040
it was cut.

55
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,040
Do you have any proof?

56
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:55,760
Do I, He Shi,

57
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:57,560
need proof to speak?

58
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,600
If this gets out,

59
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,080
do you think

60
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:07,840
people will believe you or me?

61
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:10,160
Even if it's fabricated.

62
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,880
You,

63
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:27,280
wash up nicely tonight

64
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,570
and wait for me in your room.

65
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,159
Honey,

66
00:06:51,159 --> 00:06:52,680
where are you going?

67
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:58,250
I have something to do tonight,

68
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,560
I won't be back.

69
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:04,120
Beauty, here I come.

70
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,980
Good evening, Mrs. He.

71
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:09,840
Li Zhangxin said you had something
to report to me

72
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,240
and asked me to wait here.

73
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:13,250
Since He Shi wants to report me,

74
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:15,000
I might as well go all out

75
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,520
so I won't be blackmailed.

76
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,960
Mrs. He, it's like this.

77
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:19,680
The butler, he...

78
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:21,880
I do have something to discuss with you.

79
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,280
What is it

80
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:25,320
that has to be discussed in her room?

81
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:27,120
Li Zhangxin has been at the He family

82
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,560
for a week now.

83
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:31,200
From my observation during this time,

84
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,159
she really takes

85
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:33,760
good care

86
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:35,200
of He Yu.

87
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,320
So?

88
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:41,720
Look at this north-facing room.

89
00:07:42,159 --> 00:07:43,880
It's dark and damp.

90
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,050
Since she works so hard,

91
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,760
can we move her to

92
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:49,200
a better room?

93
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,520
After all,

94
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:52,850
we have plenty of
empty rooms in the manor.

95
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:57,320
That's why I asked you
to meet me in her room.

96
00:07:58,280 --> 00:07:59,320
He Shi,

97
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:01,920
since when did you become so kind?

98
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:03,280
I've never

99
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:05,920
seen you speak up for a servant before.

100
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:08,560
After all, He Yu is my own brother.

101
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,800
I also hope he wakes up soon.

102
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:13,120
So I've been keeping
an eye on Li Zhangxin,

103
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:15,000
in case she slacks off.

104
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,440
Is that so?

105
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:21,010
You could have just told

106
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:23,360
the butler about such a trivial matter.

107
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:25,420
No need to make me come here in person.

108
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,120
Mrs. He,

109
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:40,240
Mrs. He!

110
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,720
What exactly is your motive?

111
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:52,120
We both know

112
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:54,660
He Yu's car accident wasn't an accident.

113
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,800
I had Roujing take care of him before

114
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:59,600
because she was easy to control.

115
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,000
Now that Li Zhangxin is here,

116
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:05,280
we naturally need to be more careful.

117
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,440
Don't worry.

118
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:12,080
I've already had someone look into her.

119
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,360
She's an orphan.

120
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,800
Both her parents are dead.

121
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:16,400
There's nothing suspicious about her.

122
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,480
As for you,

123
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,000
being cautious is just an excuse

124
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,760
for your affair, isn't it?

125
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:25,330
What are you talking about?

126
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,720
I'm tired.

127
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,840
I'm going to bed.

128
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:47,560
Honey, why are you back?

129
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:54,200
Didn't you say you were going out today?

130
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,600
Why are you back so early?

131
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,680
Why so many questions?

132
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:02,480
No, honey.

133
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:05,920
We can't, honey.

134
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:07,120
It will hurt the baby.

135
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:09,300
Who is more important, the baby or me?

136
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:16,720
Run!

137
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:18,960
Get over there!

138
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,760
Run!

139
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,400
Run!

140
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:40,680
Run!

141
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:41,880
He Shi,

142
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:42,520
run!

143
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:43,680
You're not even human!
